---
import GitHubIcon from "../icons/GitHubIcon.astro";
import { REPO_URL } from "../../consts";
---

<section class="cta">
  <div
    class="bg-grid"
    aria-hidden="true"
    style="-webkit-mask-image: radial-gradient(circle at 50% 50%, black, transparent 60%); mask-image: radial-gradient(circle at 50% 50%, black, transparent 60%); opacity:.4;"
  >
  </div>
  <div class="wrap">
    <span class="eyebrow reveal" style="justify-content:center;"
      >It's a metaphor, the protocol is real</span
    >
    <h2 class="reveal">A verifiable trail for every agent you run.</h2>
    <p class="reveal">
      The Find My picture is just the intuition. Underneath it is a concrete
      protocol: signed COSE receipts, HPKE encryption, and public transparency
      logs.
    </p>
    <div class="cta-btns reveal">
      <a class="btn btn-primary" href={REPO_URL} target="_blank" rel="noopener">
        <GitHubIcon />
        View the repository
      </a>
      <a class="btn btn-ghost" href="/">See how the protocol works →</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .cta {
    padding: 104px 0 116px;
    text-align: center;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--line-soft);
    position: relative;
  }

  .cta h2 {
    font-size: clamp(30px, 4vw, 48px);
    max-width: 17ch;
    margin: 18px auto 0;
  }

  .cta p {
    color: var(--ink-2);
    margin: 22px auto 0;
    max-width: 48ch;
    font-size: 18px;
  }

  .cta-btns {
    display: flex;
    gap: 14px;
    justify-content: center;
    margin-top: 36px;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
  }

  @media (max-width: 640px) {
    .cta {
      padding: 70px 0 80px;
    }
  }
</style>
